# the screen's theme (GLO, Setup KNOB 4): Light by default, Dark the near-black, cream and amber; every
# part of the screen redraws at once, and it's kept over a restart. The header shows the version.
# (params: 39 Theme; luma: brightness at (2, row): 2 the header, 60 the wood, 200 the knobs)
tap GLO
expect view 10
expect par39 0
wait 50
expect luma2 >200
expect luma200 >200
shot setup_light.png
spin K4 1
expect par39 1
wait 50
expect luma2 <40
expect luma60 <60
expect luma200 <40
shot setup_dark.png
# every page follows
tap HOME
tapkey w8
tapkey w7
wait 50
expect luma2 <40
shot home_dark.png
tap SAVE
reboot
expect par39 1
tapkey w8
tapkey w7
wait 50
expect luma2 <40
shot dark.png
# and back
tap GLO
spin K4 -1
expect par39 0
wait 50
expect luma60 >120
